component sources and notices before redistribution.

Newly generated output
----------------------
The extractor records the running device's build properties and ordered boot
classpath, original JAR and DEX hashes, class selection, available image
metadata, and original accessible system/APEX notices. Missing notices and
metadata are identified rather than replaced with an assumed license. Read
or permission failures are errors, not evidence that no notice exists.

The notice inventory may cover components beyond the extracted boot classpath;
it is not a complete component-to-source inventory. Keep applicable original
licenses, notices and source-availability obligations with redistributed
components. The project license does not supply rights to the whole SDK or
emulator image.

